#: src/ui/call-guide-dialog.ui:6
msgid "Use Vinheta in a Call"
msgstr "Utiliser Vinheta dans un appel"

#: src/ui/call-guide-dialog.ui:32
msgid ""
"Vinheta plays your sounds into the apps that are using your microphone. For "
"the other side of a call to hear them:"
msgstr ""
"Vinheta joue vos sons dans les applications qui utilisent votre microphone. "
"Pour que vos interlocuteurs les entendent :"

#: src/ui/call-guide-dialog.ui:46
msgid "Join the call as usual"
msgstr "Rejoignez l’appel comme d’habitude"

#: src/ui/call-guide-dialog.ui:47
msgid ""
"Keep your own microphone in the call app. Vinheta adds the sounds to what "
"the app records, while both are running."
msgstr ""
"Gardez votre propre microphone dans l’application d’appel. Vinheta ajoute "
"les sons à ce que l’application enregistre, tant que les deux sont ouverts."

#: src/ui/call-guide-dialog.ui:53
