#: src/ui/call-guide-dialog.ui:66
msgid ""
"Every app that is using the microphone gets them. To leave the others out, "
"pick one app in the bottom bar."
msgstr ""
"Toutes les applications qui utilisent le microphone les reçoivent. Pour "
"exclure les autres, choisissez une application dans la barre du bas."

#: src/ui/call-guide-dialog.ui:72
msgid "Step 2"
msgstr "Étape 2"

#: src/ui/call-guide-dialog.ui:85
msgid ""
"If the sounds come through choppy, look in the call app for how to turn off "
